\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 2. Ethical orientation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 A 79 suggests a potentially strong internal reference point around fairness, responsibility, and appropriate use of power.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 How it regulates risk:
\f0\b0  when strategic thinking starts drifting toward instrumental behaviour, ethical commitments can provide a boundary such as:\
\'93Would I be comfortable explaining this decision openly to the people affected?\'94\
