\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 3. Empathy\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 A 64 gives you a useful capacity to anticipate how decisions land emotionally and relationally.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 How it regulates risk:
\f0\b0  it can slow down the tendency to treat workplace relationships as purely functional and can improve repair after mistakes.\
The key is to use empathy 
\f1\b with
\f0\b0  standards, not instead of standards.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 4. Practical 4-week improvement plan\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 The aim is not to \'93fix\'94 your personality. It is to test and strengthen specific workplace behaviours.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Week 1 \'97 Observe your triggers\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 Micro-experiment\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 For one week, after any tense interaction, write down four things:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Trigger 
\f3\b0 \uc0\u8594 
\f1\b  impulse 
\f3\b0 \uc0\u8594 
\f1\b  behaviour 
\f3\b0 \uc0\u8594 
\f1\b  outcome
\f0\b0 \
Example:\
Trigger: colleague challenged my decision in a meeting.\uc0\u8232 Impulse: defend the rationale immediately.\u8232 Behaviour: interrupted twice.\u8232 Outcome: discussion became positional.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Reflection questions\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 What situations make me more controlling, defensive, or tactical?\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 What do I assume about the other person's motives?\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 What physical signs tell me I am becoming reactive?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Observable workplace behaviour\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 In your next tense discussion, 
\f1\b ask one genuine question before defending your position.
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
