\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Week 2 \'97 Make influence more transparent\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 Micro-experiment\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 When trying to persuade someone, explicitly state:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \'93Here is what I am recommending, here is why, and here is what would change my mind.\'94
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Reflection questions\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Did I provide enough information for the other person to make an informed choice?\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Did I try to influence through reasoning or through pressure?\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Was there anything I deliberately left unsaid that materially affected the decision?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Observable workplace behaviour\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 In at least two decisions, identify 
\f1\b decision criteria in advance
\f0\b0  rather than arguing from preference.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Week 3 \'97 Practice accountable empathy\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 Micro-experiment\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 When giving difficult feedback, use this sequence:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Observation 
\f3\b0 \uc0\u8594 
\f1\b  impact 
\f3\b0 \uc0\u8594 
\f1\b  expectation 
\f3\b0 \uc0\u8594 
\f1\b  support
\f0\b0 \
For example:\
\'93The report arrived two days late. That meant the team couldn't complete the review on schedule. I need future submissions by Thursday. Let's work out what would make that realistic.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Reflection questions\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Did I make the standard clear?\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Did empathy improve the conversation, or did it blur accountability?\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Have I been asking someone to improve without clearly defining what \'93improvement\'94 means?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Observable workplace behaviour\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Have 
\f1\b one conversation you've been avoiding
\f0\b0 , but make it specific, private, respectful, and measurable.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Week 4 \'97 Build a feedback loop\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 Micro-experiment\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

