\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 What pattern appeared across different people?\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Where does my intention differ from my impact?\
